WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.891
BEFORE. Red paper circles and blue squares are in different bowls.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.153
MIX. Pour the paper shapes into one tray.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.815
SEPARATE. Place circles and squares back into two groups.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.665
TELL. The materials did not change into something else.
